        <http://rdvocab.info/RDARelationshipsWEMI/guideTo> ;
    skos:definition "An expression of a work that is augmented by another work comprising material to help the user of the predominant work, such as notes, learning and study aids, exercises, problems, questions and answers, instructor or student materials, etc."@en .

<http://rdvocab.info/RDARelationshipsWEMI/guideToWork> a rdf:Property ;
